      "verify_result": {
        "command": "cargo nextest run -p bboxy450-term -E 'test(memory) | test(parked) | test(rich)' && make test-boundaries",
        "exit_code": 0,
        "evidence": [
          {
            "criterion": "The four-pane fixture recovers at least 75% of added live malloc after the final close, including a no-release negative and 12 further expirations.",
            "reference": "/Users/feral/mydev/bbx-memory/target/memory-reclaim/fixed/receipt.json and /Users/feral/mydev/bbx-memory/target/memory-reclaim/control/receipt.json"
          },
          {
            "criterion": "Open-pane layout eviction preserves scroll geometry and durable content on demand. Exact draft and reopen checks pass.",
            "reference": "/Users/feral/mydev/bbx-memory/target/memory-reclaim/harness-rich.junit.xml and /Users/feral/mydev/bbx-memory/target/memory-reclaim/scoped-nextest.junit.xml"
          },
          {
            "criterion": "PanePreparer loses at least 16 MiB of startup malloc and allocates no icon atlas. Native raster and dimming pass.",
            "reference": "/Users/feral/mydev/bbx-memory/target/memory-reclaim/atlas-after/receipt.json, /Users/feral/mydev/bbx-memory/target/memory-reclaim/pane-raster-2.log, and /Users/feral/mydev/bbx-memory/target/memory-reclaim/rich-native-parity.log"
          },
          {
            "criterion": "Native/TLC agree on the closed-owner contract and its safety-failing control. The signed harness and terminal commits are on main.",
            "reference": "/Users/feral/mydev/bbx-memory/target/memory-reclaim/term-land.log and /Users/feral/mydev/bbx-memory/target/memory-reclaim/final-check.log"
          },
          {
            "criterion": "The task's exact verify command succeeds.",
            "reference": "/Users/feral/mydev/bbx-memory/target/memory-reclaim/verify.log and /Users/feral/mydev/bbx-memory/target/memory-reclaim/verify.exit"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
    ```
    """

